Fixtures for the updater's tests in src/update.rs.

  test.pub                 a throwaway minisign key's public half; not the release key
  latest.json              a manifest for 1.9.9 naming one linux-x64 download
  latest.json.minisig      that manifest's signature by the throwaway key
  snyvi-linux-x64.tar.gz   the download: a tarball whose `snyvi` is a line of text

Made together by `node tests/fixtures/update/make.mjs`; the secret half never
touched the disk. The release key is packaging/minisign.pub, and one test here
is that it does not vouch for this manifest.
